erican (Traditional), Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"U2fN80Q-QOudDt5V-qjIlw","review_id":"OcS5eMG8Mr6lz1MQFsNC6g","date":"2020-12-07T00:25:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9590752124786377,"text_excerpt":"COVID-19 update: they're open and serving such wonderful things in a safe way! My husband and I stopped in on Saturday and had a fantastic experience. Boudin egg rolls, the brisket sandwich (that's the kind of sandwich you dream about) and a pastrami. The pastrami was done so nicely - grilled bread and just the right amount of pastrami- a side of coleslaw. Full of flavor and high quality meat - he actually ate half and saved the rest for lunch today. The brisket - where to begin- a unique spice rub really makes this sandwich stand out in a crowd. Perfectly sliced meat with just the right amount of fat on a gorgeous roll and your choice of a side. I really could only eat half - but almost ..."},{"business_id":"U2fN80Q-QOudDt5V-qjIlw","review_id":"dEnXggomGWLKGxJyUTDS6A","date":"2020-03-02T02:37:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9372490644454956,"text_excerpt":"Two words: Boudin Eggrolls. I am a bit of a boudin snob, but I LOVED those boudin egg rolls. I will admit, I am a lover of cheese and could have done with a little less so I could taste more of their perfect boudin, but overall, I will be coming back over and over and over again for those eggrolls. My hubby had the yummy pastrami sandwich. I never would have guessed he was going to order that, but he did, and it was a pretty damn delicious pastrami sandwich. I liked the decor and some of the salt and pepper shakers on the bar made me giggle. I also wanted to buy all the meat. When you walk in, you see the clear, life sized fridge/freezer with so much MEAT. I wished I could take that fridg..."},{"business_id":"U2fN80Q-QOudDt5V-qjIlw","review_id":"hO988vwoxH3ryfWG0EGGWQ","date":"2019-05-29T16:30:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9334464073181152,"text_excerpt":"Their brisket sandwich was AMAZING! The meat was so tender and juicy. Also got the boudin egg rolls. Honestly, what a great creation! Would recommend trying both of those. Can't wait to go back to get that again!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"U2fN80Q-QOudDt5V-qjIlw","photo_id":"erLmBdlHvEpn7UpTSlditQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/erLmBdlHvEpn7UpTSlditQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.89942467212677},{"business_id":"U2fN80Q-QOudDt5V-qjIlw","photo_id":"Vx2c575a_ok7awWz6GIuqA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Vx2c575a_ok7awWz6GIuqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.879871129989624},{"business_id":"U2fN80Q-QOudDt5V-qjIlw","photo_id":"eOMZTGoBuEmQv2o4cO6Krg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/eOMZTGoBuEmQv2o4cO6Krg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.803912878036499},{"business_id":"U2fN80Q-QOudDt5V-qjIlw","photo_id":"n6kWK0RV4pVOl-0shBE35Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/n6kWK0RV4pVOl-0shBE35Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7